# Environment

Copy to `.env` for local development. Never commit real secrets.

```env
# Optional local overrides (Replit artifact runtime provides these in prod).
PORT=5173
BASE_PATH=/
LOG_LEVEL=info
NODE_ENV=development

# Comma-separated production portfolio origin(s) allowed by the API's CORS
# policy, e.g. ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-portfolio-domain.com
# (localhost dev origins are allowed automatically).
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
```
